  ('channel','/ˈʧænəl/','noun','In branding and creative work, channel refers to (often plural) a means of communication or access.','The creative team considered channel while building the brand system.',null,49),
  ('copy','/ˈkɑpi/','noun','In branding and creative work, copy refers to material suitable for a journalistic account.','The creative team considered copy while building the brand system.',null,50),
  ('resolution','/ˌrɛzəˈluʃən/','noun','In branding and creative work, resolution refers to a formal expression by a meeting; agreed to by a vote.','The creative team considered resolution while building the brand system.',null,51),
  ('print','/prɪnt/','noun','In branding and creative work, print refers to a visible indication made on a surface.','The creative team considered print while building the brand system.',null,52),
  ('conversion','/kənˈvərʒən/','noun','In branding and creative work, conversion refers to a change in the units or form of an expression:.','The creative team considered conversion while building the brand system.',null,53),
