  ('impression','/ˌɪmˈprɛʃən/','noun','In branding and creative work, impression refers to a symbol that is the result of printing or engraving.','The creative team considered impression while building the brand system.',null,57),
  ('scale','/skeɪl/','verb','In branding and creative practice, to scale is to pattern, make, regulate, set, measure, or estimate according to some rate or standard.','The team used this principle to scale the idea more clearly.',null,58),
  ('essence','/ˈɛsəns/','noun','In branding and creative work, essence refers to the choicest or most essential or most vital part of some idea or experience.','The creative team considered essence while building the brand system.',null,59),
