  ('headline','/ˈhɛˌdlaɪn/','noun','In branding and creative work, headline refers to the heading or caption of a newspaper article.','The creative team considered headline while building the brand system.',null,69),
  ('resonance','/ˈrɛzənəns/','noun','In branding and creative work, resonance refers to having the character of a loud deep sound; the quality of being resonant.','The creative team considered resonance while building the brand system.',null,70),
