  ('illustration','/ˌɪləˈstreɪʃən/','noun','In branding and creative work, illustration refers to artwork that helps make something clear or attractive.','The creative team considered illustration while building the brand system.',null,72),
  ('naming','/ˈneɪmɪŋ/','noun','In branding and creative work, naming refers to the verbal act of naming.','The creative team considered naming while building the brand system.',null,73),
  ('concept','/ˈkɑnsɛpt/','noun','In branding and creative work, concept refers to an abstract or general idea inferred or derived from specific instances.','The creative team considered concept while building the brand system.',null,74),
  ('values','/ˈvæljuz/','noun','In branding and creative work, values refers to beliefs of a person or social group in which they have an emotional investment (either for or against something).','The creative team considered values while building the brand system.',null,75),
