  ('pattern','/ˈpætərn/','noun','In branding and creative work, pattern refers to graphical representation (in polar or Cartesian coordinates) of the spatial distribution of radiation from an antenna as a function of angle.','The creative team considered pattern while building the brand system.',null,83),
