  ('affinity','/əˈfɪnɪti/','noun','In branding and creative work, affinity refers to a close connection marked by community of interests or similarity in nature or character.','The creative team considered affinity while building the brand system.',null,108),
  ('saturation','/ˌsæʧərˈeɪʃən/','noun','In branding and creative work, saturation refers to chromatic purity: freedom from dilution with white and hence vivid in hue.','The creative team considered saturation while building the brand system.',null,109),
  ('crop','/krɑp/','verb','In branding and creative practice, to crop is to yield crops.','The team used this principle to crop the idea more clearly.',null,110),
  ('personality','/ˌpərsəˈnælɪti/','noun','In branding and creative work, personality refers to the complex of all the attributes--behavioral, temperamental, emotional and mental--that characterize a unique individual.','The creative team considered personality while building the brand system.',null,111),
  ('trend','/trɛnd/','noun','In branding and creative work, trend refers to a general tendency to change (as of opinion).','The creative team considered trend while building the brand system.',null,112),
  ('responsive','/rɪˈspɑnsɪv/','adjective','In brand expression, responsive describes something readily reacting or replying to people or events or stimuli; showing emotion.','The responsive direction helped the campaign express a more distinctive character.',null,113),
  ('reputation','/ˌrɛpjəˈteɪʃən/','noun','In branding and creative work, reputation refers to the general estimation that the public has for a person.','The creative team considered reputation while building the brand system.',null,114),
