  ('advocacy','/ˈædvəkəsi/','noun','In branding and creative work, advocacy refers to active support of an idea or cause etc.; especially the act of pleading or arguing for something.','The creative team considered advocacy while building the brand system.',null,117),
  ('creative','/kriˈeɪtɪv/','adjective','In brand expression, creative describes something having the ability or power to create.','The creative direction helped the campaign express a more distinctive character.',null,118),
