  ('metric','/ˈmɛtrɪk/','noun','In branding and creative work, metric refers to a function of a topological space that gives, for any two points in the space, a value equal to the distance between them.','The creative team considered metric while building the brand system.',null,126),
  ('hierarchy','/ˈhaɪərˌɑrki/','noun','In branding and creative work, hierarchy refers to a series of ordered groupings of people or things within a system.','The creative team considered hierarchy while building the brand system.',null,127),
