  ('distinctive','/dɪˈstɪŋktɪv/','adjective','In brand expression, distinctive describes something of a feature that helps to distinguish a person or thing; - Curtis Wilkie.','The distinctive direction helped the campaign express a more distinctive character.',null,129),
  ('photography','/fəˈtɑgrəfi/','noun','In branding and creative work, photography refers to the occupation of taking and printing photographs or making movies.','The creative team considered photography while building the brand system.',null,130),
